<title>RUSSIA: Surgutneftegaz '96 oil output 33.3 mln T.</title>
<headline>Surgutneftegaz '96 oil output 33.3 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian oil company Surgutneftegaz said in a statement on Thursday that its 1996 crude oil output was 33.3 million tonnes.</p>
<p>Surgut produced 33.2 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
</text>
